MTGS renderer speedups for the nuPlan track: renders only the cameras a request names instead of every camera of the
recording, scales, casts and flips the frames on the GPU, and reuses the undistortion maps across scenes. The frames
match the unpatched renderer up to a few pixels: in a test, 157 of 2 million pixels of a frame differed, by at most 3
levels. setup_alpasim.sh applies it.

